{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15967","headline":"白紵歌二首 二 · 王建","name":"白紵歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"馆娃宫中春日暮，荔枝木瓜花满树。\n城头乌栖休击鼓，青蛾弹瑟白紵舞。\n夜天曈曈不见星，宫中火照西江明。\n美人醉起无次第，堕钗遗佩满中庭。\n此时但愿可君意，回昼爲宵亦不寐，年年奉君君莫弃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}